  "method": {
   "confidence": "drawing",
   "note": "FIGURES FROM THE MAKER'S OWN DRAWING. StarTech.com publishes CABLMANAGERH_Diagram.pdf (third angle projection, \"DO NOT SCALE\", millimetres, uploaded 11/23/2023): a side view and a front view and an isometric, with the dimensions 482.60, 95.00, 6.21, 43.69, 32.00, 465.00, \"phi 29.00\" and \"phi 6.50\". The datasheet (cablmanagerh_datasheet.pdf) lists the same body as \"Product Length 19.0 in\", \"Product Width 1.7 in [43.7 mm]\" and \"Product Height 3.7 in [95.0 mm]\", where \"width\" is the panel's height and \"height\" is its depth. The drawing is the one used where they differ: 43.69, not the datasheet's 43.7. What it does not dimension - the rings' place and size, the holes' place, the fold's length - is scaled off it at 2.45 to 3.85 px/mm against its own dimensions, and is estimated."
