  "passes": {
   "confidence": "drawing",
   "note": "drawing - the four holes, \"phi 29.00\": a cable crosses through each from one side of the panel to the other. Their places (100.0 apart, 91.3 from the left end) are scaled and estimated. The maker's note, \"Power cables may not fit through the holes on this panel\" (datasheet, Special Notes), is recorded in `attrs.features`; the format has no way to say which cable is too thick for a pass, so a pass is declared at its drawn size, open."
